        "description": "code-server 4.139.1 with the pi coding agent (0.99.1) and Claude Code (2.1.285), pi-acp and the ACP Client chat sidebar baked in — WOOWTECH build layered on the Home Assistant Community vscode add-on",
        "url": "https://github.com/WOOWTECH/Woow_ha_code_server_add_on",
